    "body": "Status: the work and the gates are done. The PR is not open yet.\n\n- Branch: `issue/4025-kernel-region`, head `cfef8048f`. It starts from the head of PR #4123 (`9ea79086c`).\n- PR #4123 is still open. When it merges, this branch takes `git merge origin/side/path-kernel`, and the PR opens with `--base side/path-kernel`.\n- Gates on `cfef8048f`:\n  - quick gate against `origin/issue/4055-pathkernel-skeleton`: 184 steps, 0 failed;\n  - `example_catalog`, `example_catalog_adaptive`, `example_catalog_edge_work`: pass;\n  - `cargo xtask gate light`: 6 steps, 0 failed;\n  - clippy on `camcraft-pathkernel`, `camcraft-motion` and `camcraft-app`: clean.\n- Pins: the `laws` region submodule (8 tests) and the motion `kernel_region` tests (5 tests).\n- Decisions: `docs/decisions/4025-kernel-region.md`.\n\nThe claim stays until the PR opens.\n",
